                    digital world.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-4">

                <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3 hm-reveal">
                    <div class="hm-card hm-course">
                        <span class="hm-num">01</span>
                        <div class="hm-icon"><i class="bi bi-code-slash"></i></div>
                        <h3>Web Development</h3>
                        <p>
                            Learn to build modern, responsive websites and
                            web applications using industry-relevant technologies.
                        </p>
                        <a href="#feedback" class="hm-link">Learn More <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3 hm-reveal">
                    <div class="hm-card hm-course">
                        <span class="hm-num">02</span>
                        <div class="hm-icon"><i class="bi bi-phone"></i></div>
                        <h3>Android Development</h3>
                        <p>
                            Discover mobile app development and learn how
